      "name": "Slack Off",
      "desc": "Increases the wearer's CRIT DMG by <color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color> and Energy Regeneration Rate by <color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#5[i]%</unbreak></color>. When the wearer uses a Basic ATK, they gain \"Snack,\" lasting for 2 turns. While \"Snack\" is active, the wearer's ATK increases by <color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>. At the start of battle or when the wearer uses their Ultimate, they gain \"Iced Drink,\" lasting for 3 turns. While \"Iced Drink\" is active, Basic ATK and Ultimate DMG dealt by the wearer ignores <color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#3[i]%</unbreak></color> of the target's DEF. When the wearer has both \"Snack\" and \"Iced Drink\" simultaneously, they additionally gain \"Good Mood,\" and Basic ATK and Ultimate DMG dealt additionally ignores <color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#4[i]%</unbreak></color> of the target's DEF.",
